From 8f740f4a52be8aca718de9d124801c6a38058c1e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 2 Jun 2026 11:28:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: light/dark mode UI bugs across 7 files

- bd-commission: replace bg-black/bg-white tabs with theme-aware fg/bg
- finance-config: fix bg-black button + bg-red-50 alert to use theme vars
- assignments-card: border-white/10 -> border (invisible in light mode)
- deadline-extend: border-white/10 -> border (invisible in light mode)
- workforce: fix bg-gray-100 badge + text-green-700 dark pair
- admin-ops-tasks: replace all #262d40/#181c27/#1e2333 with theme vars,
  off-brand blue buttons -> primary (blood red), red-400 errors -> destructive
- employee-ops-tasks: same dark-only hex replacements + button fixes
